%Y A342002 Cf. A342463 [= a(A329886(n))], A342920 [= a(A108951(n))], A342921 [= a(A276156(n))], A342017 [= A342007(a(n))], A342019 [= A129251(a(n))].
%Y A342002 Cf. A166486 (a(n) mod 2, parity of terms, see comment in A327860), A353640 (a(n) mod 4).
